# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  DENY-BY-DEFAULT
#
#  This repository is PUBLIC and lives alongside live Orange O Tec financial
#  data (general ledger, balance sheet, bank vouchers, stock, fund flow).
#  Nothing is committed unless it is explicitly re-allowed below.
#
#  If you add a new data file it stays private automatically.
#  If you add a new script, it is picked up by the extension rules below.
#  DO NOT replace this with a normal "list the things to ignore" .gitignore.
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# 1. Ignore everything.
*

# 2. Descend into directories so the allowlist below can be reached.
!*/

# ── 3. Allowlist: source code and documentation ───────────────────────────
!.gitignore
!README.md
!CLAUDE.md
!*.md
!*.py
!*.js
!*.mjs
!*.cjs
!*.ts
!*.html
!*.ps1
!LICENSE.txt

# Project manifests and committed config
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!.claude/settings.json

# ── 4. Hard denies — these win over everything above ──────────────────────

# Dependencies and build artefacts
node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.map
.tmp_baseline/

# Machine-local config (contains absolute paths / per-machine permissions)
.claude/settings.local.json
.env
*.code-workspace

# Personal material, unrelated to this project
NISM/
CV/
Perosnal/
RITESH Perosnal/

# ── 5. Financial data — NEVER commit to a public repo ─────────────────────
# (already covered by the blanket `*`, repeated here as an explicit guard)
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.xlsm
*.csv
*.pdf
*.docx
*.parquet
*.pkl
*.xml

# Generated caches and snapshots
gp_voucher_cache.json
gp_segment_cache.json
*.grouping_snapshot.json

# Output / working directories
outputs/
Files/*.xlsx
Inventory/
FUND FLOW/*.xlsx
Old Version*/
